WEBVTT

00:00:00.430 --> 00:00:02.415
Something happens in your business.

00:00:02.675 --> 00:00:05.905
A machine stops. Your engineer sees a fault.

00:00:06.130 --> 00:00:10.090
Operations sees a delay. Finance sees a cost.

00:00:10.350 --> 00:00:13.640
Your customer sees a promise you might not keep.

00:00:14.195 --> 00:00:16.470
Four perspectives. One event.

00:00:17.750 --> 00:00:21.650
An institution already owns much of the knowledge it needs.

00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:24.075
A contract sits in one folder.

00:00:24.355 --> 00:00:26.675
A delivery date lives in a spreadsheet.

00:00:26.970 --> 00:00:29.605
A decision disappears into a meeting.

00:00:29.955 --> 00:00:34.100
Someone copies the same facts between applications, while the

00:00:34.110 --> 00:00:38.430
situation keeps changing. The problem is carrying understanding

00:00:38.440 --> 00:00:40.750
all the way into useful work.

00:00:41.963 --> 00:00:44.583
Now place that problem in two settings.

00:00:44.898 --> 00:00:48.963
A growing organisation needs useful capability without a

00:00:48.973 --> 00:00:50.493
large technical department.

00:00:50.843 --> 00:00:55.103
An established institution needs to coordinate complex systems

00:00:55.153 --> 00:00:56.993
without surrendering control.

00:00:57.353 --> 00:00:59.108
Their circumstances differ.

00:00:59.368 --> 00:01:03.508
Both need technology that fits the world they actually operate in.

00:01:04.717 --> 00:01:08.667
For a growing organisation in a developing market, a broken

00:01:08.677 --> 00:01:11.677
connection can interrupt a cloud-dependent task.

00:01:12.082 --> 00:01:16.282
Training, technical support and recurring costs also matter.

00:01:16.672 --> 00:01:20.927
Our local and cloud-optional design gives the programme a way to

00:01:20.937 --> 00:01:23.822
qualify essential work close to its users.

00:01:24.402 --> 00:01:28.797
Across markets, our goal is the same: people working in their

00:01:28.807 --> 00:01:32.797
own language, with local ownership and support built into

00:01:32.807 --> 00:01:33.322
delivery.

00:01:34.117 --> 00:01:37.837
For an established organisation in a developed market, the

00:01:37.847 --> 00:01:41.787
difficulty may be connecting years of documents, applications

00:01:41.797 --> 00:01:43.882
and institutional knowledge.

00:01:44.337 --> 00:01:46.652
Sensitive records have boundaries.

00:01:46.927 --> 00:01:49.302
Different teams have different powers.

00:01:49.647 --> 00:01:51.817
Decisions need an explanation.

00:01:52.372 --> 00:01:56.347
Here, the same foundations support controlled integration,

00:01:56.512 --> 00:02:00.067
traceable actions and deployment choices that fit the

00:02:00.077 --> 00:02:01.477
institution's requirements.

00:02:02.497 --> 00:02:06.722
These needs overlap. Any factory can lose its connection.

00:02:07.027 --> 00:02:10.262
Any bank can require rigorous access control.

00:02:10.887 --> 00:02:15.227
Wyrd starts with the institution, its people and its operating

00:02:15.237 --> 00:02:19.477
conditions. The value lies in bringing usable applications,

00:02:19.582 --> 00:02:23.757
connected intelligence, authority and evidence into one

00:02:23.767 --> 00:02:24.997
coherent programme.

00:02:25.997 --> 00:02:29.307
Wyrd grew through the same method it wants to make available to

00:02:29.317 --> 00:02:33.597
others. Alec de Carvalho used AI to turn questions and

00:02:33.607 --> 00:02:35.842
metaphors into working components.

00:02:36.162 --> 00:02:40.337
Today, Alec, Rafael Reis, Maxime Binard and Cal

00:02:40.347 --> 00:02:44.657
Poppink bring product direction, engineering, relationships and

00:02:44.667 --> 00:02:45.987
entrepreneurship together.

00:02:46.387 --> 00:02:50.552
Labs and Creative support WyrdWork, ARGOS, Biota

00:02:50.562 --> 00:02:51.417
and Corpus.

00:02:52.817 --> 00:02:56.702
Those divisions apply shared foundations to institutions,

00:02:56.792 --> 00:03:01.202
intelligence, private personal systems and the physical world.

00:03:01.667 --> 00:03:05.997
Our founding conviction is monism: reality remains

00:03:06.007 --> 00:03:08.677
whole beneath the divisions of our knowledge.

00:03:08.997 --> 00:03:13.002
We want intelligence to carry understanding between perspectives

00:03:13.187 --> 00:03:17.567
without losing the situation, purpose or responsibility connecting

00:03:17.577 --> 00:03:20.817
them. One intelligence. Many modes.

00:03:22.783 --> 00:03:26.753
Wyrd Unified Intelligence gives that direction an architectural

00:03:26.763 --> 00:03:30.923
expression. Its unity comes from continuity: the

00:03:30.933 --> 00:03:35.418
same situation, relevant permitted memory, a shared objective,

00:03:35.588 --> 00:03:38.203
and an account of actions and results.

00:03:38.603 --> 00:03:42.653
Different models and tools contribute without losing the thread of

00:03:42.663 --> 00:03:43.983
what the work is for.

00:03:45.310 --> 00:03:48.135
Memory gives that continuity a history.

00:03:48.620 --> 00:03:52.885
A useful memory connects what was observed, what was believed,

00:03:53.095 --> 00:03:56.315
what was authorised and what actually happened.

00:03:56.810 --> 00:04:00.280
Sources, versions and uncertainty matter.

00:04:00.725 --> 00:04:04.965
Access remains bounded: a common architecture does not

00:04:04.975 --> 00:04:08.850
give every person or agent permission to every memory.

00:04:10.570 --> 00:04:14.100
Embodiment gives intelligence a world that can answer it.

00:04:14.530 --> 00:04:18.890
Sensors, software and machines reveal whether an expectation

00:04:18.900 --> 00:04:21.090
survives contact with reality.

00:04:21.470 --> 00:04:24.115
Results return to memory and review.

00:04:24.600 --> 00:04:28.960
Learning means revising understanding from evidence; changes to

00:04:28.970 --> 00:04:32.530
models or operating rules require their own validation.

00:04:33.910 --> 00:04:35.955
A military unit needs supplies.

00:04:36.050 --> 00:04:37.930
Civilians need evacuation.

00:04:37.995 --> 00:04:40.990
Roads are damaged and communications are failing.

00:04:41.797 --> 00:04:45.507
Corpus is Wyrd’s programme for intelligence that acts through

00:04:45.517 --> 00:04:49.437
physical bodies, with defence central and civilian services

00:04:49.447 --> 00:04:49.977
alongside.

00:04:51.217 --> 00:04:53.702
WUI combines permitted information.

00:04:54.267 --> 00:04:56.942
People approve bounded tasks.

00:04:57.362 --> 00:05:01.537
Local models interpret; dedicated controllers handle movement

00:05:01.547 --> 00:05:02.417
and safety.

00:05:03.343 --> 00:05:07.473
Bodies survey, locate civilians, resupply

00:05:07.483 --> 00:05:11.453
and reconnect. Disconnected work stays

00:05:11.463 --> 00:05:14.428
bounded; unapproved tasks wait.

00:05:15.093 --> 00:05:17.883
Records reconcile on reconnection.

00:05:18.703 --> 00:05:22.733
Modular bodies receive compatible sensors, payloads and protection

00:05:22.743 --> 00:05:26.483
for the mission. Selected bodies could eventually dock and

00:05:26.493 --> 00:05:27.318
reconfigure.

00:05:28.177 --> 00:05:31.987
Defence spans reconnaissance, protection, logistics,

00:05:32.252 --> 00:05:35.887
casualty support and armed-system concepts.

00:05:36.517 --> 00:05:38.807
Human command retains weapons release.

00:05:39.117 --> 00:05:43.122
Security and border programmes support authorised patrols.

00:05:43.873 --> 00:05:47.743
Planned applications include medical delivery, patient

00:05:47.753 --> 00:05:52.188
assistance, rehabilitation and clinician-controlled equipment;

00:05:52.763 --> 00:05:57.178
firefighting; consumer delivery, remote cargo,

00:05:57.393 --> 00:06:01.683
industry, mining, entertainment and sport.

00:06:02.483 --> 00:06:04.618
Leviathan takes Corpus underwater.

00:06:05.333 --> 00:06:08.833
AgenticX is planned for compatible third-party bodies.

00:06:09.398 --> 00:06:13.803
Planned Wyrd satellites support low-data machine connectivity.

00:06:14.983 --> 00:06:19.288
Customers buy equipment and integration, or pay for missions:

00:06:19.708 --> 00:06:23.003
verified results without owning a permanent fleet.

00:06:23.930 --> 00:06:28.340
Software exists. Bodies need engineering and qualification.

00:06:28.680 --> 00:06:32.875
Intelligence, authority and machines unite for verifiable results.

00:06:34.010 --> 00:06:38.050
People and institutions define the authority under which this work

00:06:38.060 --> 00:06:42.070
happens. Standing mandates can permit bounded autonomy.

00:06:42.505 --> 00:06:45.700
Actions needing additional approval wait for it.

00:06:46.295 --> 00:06:50.130
ICARUS checks protected actions against the applicable authority,

00:06:50.380 --> 00:06:54.815
while evidence connects the request, decision, attempted action

00:06:54.935 --> 00:06:56.280
and observed result.

00:06:58.010 --> 00:07:02.330
Customer control includes data, eligible models, keys

00:07:02.425 --> 00:07:06.380
and decisions. Local, hybrid and cloud

00:07:06.390 --> 00:07:08.970
configurations can serve different constraints.

00:07:09.380 --> 00:07:13.280
Disconnected operation requires the complete workflow to be

00:07:13.290 --> 00:07:17.590
qualified locally. As connectivity changes, the institution

00:07:17.600 --> 00:07:22.080
should retain a clear account of what can continue, what must wait

00:07:22.365 --> 00:07:24.250
and who remains in control.

00:07:26.223 --> 00:07:29.968
Wyrd Work is the employee's daily workspace for documents,

00:07:29.978 --> 00:07:34.313
spreadsheets, presentations, communication and meetings, with

00:07:34.323 --> 00:07:36.463
routine AI assistance included.

00:07:36.853 --> 00:07:39.588
Familiar tasks become connected work.

00:07:40.203 --> 00:07:44.203
Our ambition is to make this accessible in every language, with

00:07:44.213 --> 00:07:46.853
capable tools and clear interfaces.

00:07:47.238 --> 00:07:51.513
Each language needs localisation, testing and support, so people

00:07:51.523 --> 00:07:53.763
can work in the language they know best.

00:07:54.777 --> 00:07:59.167
Wyrd Unified Intelligence for Work connects permitted institutional

00:07:59.177 --> 00:08:03.267
knowledge, operational state, analysis and authorised

00:08:03.277 --> 00:08:07.347
work. It can connect to Work or to agreed existing

00:08:07.357 --> 00:08:11.682
systems. It is a separate intelligence and operations platform.

00:08:12.132 --> 00:08:16.067
The wider architecture also supports applications beyond the

00:08:16.077 --> 00:08:17.317
institutional workspace.

00:08:19.357 --> 00:08:23.607
Imagine a supplier delay. An employee asks for help in

00:08:23.617 --> 00:08:27.897
ordinary English. Permitted records establish the agreement and

00:08:27.907 --> 00:08:31.637
the delivery. The system relates the disruption to customer

00:08:31.647 --> 00:08:33.762
commitments and responsible teams.

00:08:34.092 --> 00:08:38.017
It develops options using the institution's objectives and the

00:08:38.027 --> 00:08:39.037
evidence available.

00:08:40.217 --> 00:08:44.147
The responsible person can challenge or choose a response.

00:08:44.602 --> 00:08:47.932
Authorised tasks move to people and tools.

00:08:48.352 --> 00:08:52.767
The eventual send or change receives its required checks.

00:08:53.147 --> 00:08:56.822
Then the result updates the same operational picture.

00:08:57.267 --> 00:09:00.937
If the response fails, that failure becomes something the

00:09:00.947 --> 00:09:03.477
institution can examine and learn from.

00:09:05.190 --> 00:09:08.355
There is implementation evidence behind this direction.

00:09:08.695 --> 00:09:12.930
In a retained installed ICARUS test, the destination of a file

00:09:12.940 --> 00:09:15.020
action changed after approval.

00:09:15.370 --> 00:09:18.285
The action was refused before publication.

00:09:18.610 --> 00:09:22.620
That is a concrete behaviour we can inspect, within the conditions

00:09:22.630 --> 00:09:23.605
of that test.

00:09:25.230 --> 00:09:29.000
Our case rests on the connections we are building and the behaviour

00:09:29.010 --> 00:09:33.240
we can demonstrate. Working components and selected workflows

00:09:33.250 --> 00:09:37.725
already exist. Complete integration, local operation,

00:09:37.820 --> 00:09:41.860
security, recovery and customer acceptance must be

00:09:41.870 --> 00:09:45.620
qualified together. That is how the programme can turn

00:09:45.630 --> 00:09:49.850
architectural ambition into a dependable service for a particular

00:09:49.860 --> 00:09:50.550
institution.

00:09:51.817 --> 00:09:55.897
By twenty twenty-eight, this is the network we intend to build.

00:09:56.217 --> 00:10:00.322
A holding in Zug. European coordination in Lisbon,

00:10:00.422 --> 00:10:03.667
operating in Portugal and across the European Union.

00:10:03.927 --> 00:10:08.147
Singapore for the Asian continental platform, with the Chinese local

00:10:08.157 --> 00:10:12.342
company in Macau. Dubai anchors the Middle East platform.

00:10:12.612 --> 00:10:15.232
Angola anchors the African platform.

00:10:15.427 --> 00:10:19.617
Its first expansion wave adds South Africa, Kenya, Egypt,

00:10:19.672 --> 00:10:23.337
Morocco, Nigeria, Ghana and Côte d’Ivoire.

00:10:23.642 --> 00:10:27.927
Mozambique and Tanzania follow in twenty twenty-nine, then Senegal

00:10:27.937 --> 00:10:29.992
and Namibia in twenty thirty.

00:10:30.332 --> 00:10:34.417
Montreal anchors North America and our Canadian operation, with a

00:10:34.427 --> 00:10:36.522
United States pole in Boston.

00:10:36.797 --> 00:10:41.262
São Paulo anchors South America, with a Colombian pole in Bogotá.

00:10:41.677 --> 00:10:45.607
A connected structure, built through local people and locally

00:10:45.617 --> 00:10:46.697
qualified delivery.

00:10:47.810 --> 00:10:49.715
Knowledge into understanding.

00:10:50.100 --> 00:10:53.075
Understanding into useful capability.

00:10:53.615 --> 00:10:57.670
Across different economies, infrastructures and institutions,

00:10:57.910 --> 00:11:01.880
people retain authority over what their technology can do.

00:11:02.390 --> 00:11:05.055
One intelligence. Many modes.

00:11:05.395 --> 00:11:07.870
That is the Wyrd we are building.
